Subject: [PATCH 0006/0012] make the stream window the presentation path

The DMA-BUF window becomes the default route (the Qt swapchain stays available
through OPENNOW_WAYLAND_VIDEO=0 for the A/B runs). The window takes the pointer
and the keyboard, the frame descriptor stays open until Wayland has flushed it,
and the compositor keeps one buffer per decoder buffer instead of one per
frame, so the decoder's small pool is reused instead of re-imported.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [STM32MP25 performance work]

